//PROPOGANDA PLAQUES - NOVA PRAETORIA

//Propaganda Plaque 1
"PraetoriaTour1" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>The People of Praetoria dedicate their lives to the glory of the State and its unquestioned master:<br><br> <scale 1.25> Emperor Marcus Cole</span></face></font></scale><br><br>Emperor Marcus Cole was honored by the City and Citizens of Praetoria on June 25, AU35 for his tireless dedication to the safety and happiness of his people.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><b>-</b></span></face></font><br>So long as Emperor Cole, magnificent savior of Praetoria, stands as a shining beacon of hope in this dark world, ever shall the grateful people follow his unerring lead towards our collective prosperity.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><b>-</b></span></face></font><br>The Emperor and his people: indomitable spirit and unshakable resolve, together they guide Praetoria toward a glorious future."

//Propaganda Plaque 2
"PraetoriaTour2" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>"The inimitable orator Emperor Marcus Cole speaks with the voice of the people, making manifest the tenets of the State."</span></face></font><br><br>At this site in October 6, AU34, the great Emperor Marcus Cole, beloved guardian of Praetoria, favored the people with his moving 'Brave Cole World' speech, inaugurating the construction of the Magisterium and the Nova Praetoria Plaza.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>-</span></face></font><br><br>The Magisterium stands as a symbol of the sophisticated and seasoned leadership of grand Emperor Marcus Cole; the source of all victories and miraculous achievements in Praetoria."

//Resistance Plaque 1
"Resistance1" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>Lesson 1: Don't Believe Your Eyes</span></face></font><br><br>Just because it all looks jim-dandy don't mean that's what's really goin' on.  You're dreamin', sleepyhead.  Wake yer peepers and you'll see that it's not all sunshine, rainbows, and unicorns havin' a tea party."

//Resistance Plaque 2
"Resistance2" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>Lesson 2: Don't Believe Everything You Read</span></face></font><br><br>Just because it's on a poster don't make it true.  Someone got paid a fat wad of cash to put those words in print.  <br><br>And who was handing over those tasty bucks?  Surprise!  It's COLE!  Read between the lines and you might just see his beady little eyes peeping you a good one right back."

//Resistance Plaque 3
"Resistance3" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>Lesson 3: The Tunnels Are Your Refuge</span></face></font><br><br>Did you wake up and see that wonderland ain't all toothy cats and tea parties?  Then go follow Alice down the rabbit hole and take a big ol' chomp from a slice of the tasty, tasty truth."

//Resistance Plaque 4
"Resistance4" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>Lesson 4: Your Thoughts Are Not Your Own</span></face></font><br><br>Like all that flashy gizmo doodad biotech you see lately?  Also like Seers reading your mind?  You probably do, since they've been shovin' those thoughts in your scrambled little noggin.  Think about that for a for a moment...or can you?"

//Resistance Plaque 5
"Resistance5" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=pink>Lesson 5: The Police Are Not Your Protectors</span></face></font><br><br>Sticks and stones will break your bones, and so will the boys in blue and gold.  They're here to keep you in line, not help you.  You're a squealing little piggie and they're the big bad wolf, got it?  And they've got the sticks and stones."

//Resisted Protest
"P_Resisted" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>Crush Thy Enemy</span></face></font><br><br>It was at this location that Emperor Cole's Imperial Defense Force quashed a massive riot carelessly inflamed by Resistance dissidents. A little girl's dog was seriously injured, though saved by the tireless work of the IDF."

//Cole Memorial Plaque
"ColeMemorial" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>Emperor Cole's Hospital of Praetoria</span></face></font> <br><br>Every citizen is like a child to the beneficent father, Emperor Marcus Cole. Their health and welfare are of the utmost importance to him, as the health of the people is a reflection of the health of The State.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>-</span></face></font><br><br>To that end he has given this hospital as a gift to his many children who cry out for an end to their suffering. None shall want for health and prosperity while under the peerless leadership of Emperor Marcus Cole.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>-</span></face></font><br><br>No injuries to the body or mind shall divert the people of Praetoria and their beloved Emperor; such is the strength of their patriotic spirit and unconquerable will."

//Magisterium Culture Plaque
"MagisteriumCulture" "The magnificent Emperor Marcus Cole, selfless benefactor to the Praetorian people, presents this gift of culture and high art to the citizens.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>-</span></face></font><br><br>As a master of the written word, having crafted over a hundred plays, over a thousand books, and poems beyond counting, Emperor Marcus Cole understands the power of art and culture to demonstrate, never clearer, the vibrant prosperity and brilliant victories of the present day.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold>-</span></face></font><br><br>Through word and song the political and ideological purity of the Praetorian state is demonstrated for all to see."

//Statue_Antimatter
"Statue_Antimatter" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=orange><scale 1.15>Praetor Keyes</scale></span></face></font> <face heading><span align=center><font color=orange><i>In the end only science matters.</i></span></face></font> At the pinnacle of our society resides our most admired and joyous leader, the Emperor Marcus Cole. Beneath him is the apparatus of the State. Beneath the State are the people who benefit from its auspices. And beneath the people, bearing us upon a million bent backs and upraised arms are our tireless servants: the Clockwork.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=orange>-</span></face></font><br>It is to the Clockwork we can thank for easing from us our labors so we may engage in more enlightened pursuits: art, literature, and philosophies of crystalline truth. Together this has produced propitious minds dedicated to the cause of our beloved and nurturing Emperor Marcus Cole.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=orange>-</span></face></font><br>We must all thank the scientist Anti-Matter for building the first Clockworks under the inestimable guidance of our Emperor Marcus Cole."

//Statue_Chimera
"Statue_Chimera" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=salmon><scale 1.15>Praetor Sinclair</scale></span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=salmon><i><scale .80>Only through social engineering can we keep the sheep from becoming the wolves.</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br>Few can match the love and devotion our masterful general and benefactor Emperor Marcus Cole feels for every last citizen of Praetoria, but of that few Praetor Sinclair is at the forefront.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=pink><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>Our tireless guardian is ever watchful for threats to the peace and security of Praetoria and its people.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=salmon><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>There are none to whom the magnanimous Emperor Marcus Cole would entrust such an important task as this but the hunter without equal: Praetor Sinclair."

//Statue_Marauder
"Statue_Marauder" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><scale 1.15>Praetor White</scale></span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><i><scale .80>Maintain the order and conformity of Praetoria</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br>Praetor White is the mailed fist of Praetoria, throttling the life from its enemies. Our most mighty Emperor Marcus Cole's greatest weapon against injustice and tyranny. All people everywhere do justly praise their warrior protector, who's sacrifice of flesh, bone, and blood has ensured our continued prosperity.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>Under the unerring generalship of our great and dear master Emperor Marcus Cole, Praetor White will forever stand steadfast against all threats to our national prosperity. Beloved warrior and selfless soldier, Praetor White shall never falter in the face of our enemies."

//Statue_Neuron
"Statue_Neuron" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><scale 1.15>Praetor Berry</scale></span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><i><scale .80>Better living through chemistry</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br>Praetoria stands as a shining example of mankind's technological prowess. Without it our enemies, envious of our prosperity and embittered by our success, would have long ago made slaves of us all.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>Under the masterful direction of our most enlightened Emperor Marcus Cole, Praetoria's leading scientist has devoted himself to the betterment of the State and its people. Only through the guiding intellect of our august Emperor Marcus Cole, Praetor Berry has brought peace, comfort, ease, and relief from toil enjoyed by all Praetorians everywhere."

//Statue_MotherMayhem
"Statue_MotherMayhem" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><scale 1.15>Praetor Tilman: "Mother"</scale> </span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><i><scale .80>Mother is here for you. She will keep you safe.</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br> As our loving and protective Emperor Marcus Cole is the father of our great nation, so Praetor Tilman is the comforting mother who nurtures her many children: the people of Praetoria for who's welfare she has dedicated her life.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>Her piercing gaze sweeps aside the veils of deception that hide the enemies of our glorious nation, securing a lasting peace for all Praetorians. So devoted is she, that she has given to us her daughters, our dedicated Seers, so that impure thoughts are never given a chance to become unlawful deeds."

//Statue_Dominatrix
"Statue_Dominatrix" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=yellow><scale 1.15>Praetor Duncan</scale></span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=yellow><i><scale .80>The pursuit of liberty requires sacrifice. What are you prepared to lose?</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br>Our masterful leader Emperor Marcus Cole has taught us that history is one of our greatest tools. A tool we use to build the foundation of our present and the framework of our future.<br><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=yellow><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>Praetor Duncan stands as an example of the power of history carrying into the present day, as the daughter of Miss Liberty she bears that proud heritage forward, continuing the tradition of service and sacrifice so that we may all have lives of comfort and safety without fear of destruction at the hand of our implacable enemies."

//Statue_Tyrant
"Statue_Tyrant" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=gold><scale 1.15>Emperor Marcus Cole</scale> </span></face></font><br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><i><scale .80>Our Mighty and Most Beneficent Leader</scale></i></span></face></font><br><br>Look now upon the face of your benefactor. His eyes cast always to the horizon of our collective prosperity, Emperor Marcus Cole bravely stands at the vanguard to vouchsafe our security.<br><face heading><span align=center><font color=lightblue><b>-</b></span></face></font><br><br>"I call upon you, people of Praetoria, to cast aside all doubt and fear, to carry up your brothers and sisters so that all may stand tall and proud. Hold your head up high and challenge the darkness to cloud our growing dawn, for it is the fires of our righteous cause that shall carry the day."

//EASTER EGGS - NOVA PRAETORIA

//LOYALIST LOUNGE

//Enriche Bottles
"EE_Enriche_01" "Citizens loyal to Emperor Cole get free Enriche at this lounge!"

//Phone
"EE_Phone_01" "You hear a dial tone and wonder if anyone would know if you made a long distance call."

//Guest List Folder
"EE_GuestList_01" "<face heading><font color=pink><span align=center>[This folder is pretty thick]</face></font></span><br><br>You sneak a peek at the list of names on the Guest List.  Who's Abe Froman?"

//Vending Machine
"EE_VendingMachine_01" "<face heading><font color=pink><span align=center>[You look inside ]</face></font></span><br><br>Hm.  Some pretty tasty stuff in here.  All Cole-Approved, too, so it must be good for you."





